    <bpmn:process id="W_W4196" name="W4196. Event Audience, Targeting &amp; Trade-Pro Invitation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Per-event audience planning
Frequency: Per event
Volume: ~5,200 trade accounts + ~200 corporate accounts + prospects; show audiences ~10K–100K+
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Trade Sales (VS-11/VS-107)
Participants: Trade-Pro Program (VS-43), Key Accounts (VS-107), CDP (VS-126), Insights (VS-44)
Source: workflow W4196 — Event Audience, Targeting &amp; Trade-Pro Invitation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4196_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4196_Lane1" name="Event Marketing Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4196_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4196_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4196_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4196_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4196_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4196_Start3" name="Per-event audience planning">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4196_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4196_Task4" name="Event Marketing/Trade Sales define the target audience per event (segments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Event Marketing/Trade Sales define the target audience per event (segments, geography, account tier — trade-pro, named accounts, prospects) from the CDP/trade-pro base (VS-126/VS-43)
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Trade Sales / CDP
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4196_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4196_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4196_Task5" name="Event Marketing/Trade-Pro execute invitations/registration (email, call…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Event Marketing/Trade-Pro execute invitations/registration (email, call, account-manager outreach, VIP pass), and manage RSVP/attendance logistics
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Trade-Pro / Key Accounts
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4196_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4196_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4196_Task6" name="Event Marketing capture pre-event audience data (registrations, account…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Event Marketing capture pre-event audience data (registrations, account mapping) for lead-routing (W4214) and measure attendance vs target (W4216)
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / CDP
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4196_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4196_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4196_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4196_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-647 (ensure controlled execution — Event Marketing Strategy, Portfolio &amp; Calendar Management (PA-139.1).) | - CTL-647: audience targeting data-privacy compliant (VS-91); consent for marketing captured
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Trade Sales (VS-11/VS-107)</bpmn:text>
