    <bpmn:process id="W_W4197" name="W4197. Vendor Co-Funding, Co-Exhibition &amp; MDF Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Event decision; vendor partnership opportunity
Frequency: Per event
Volume: ~800–1,000 vendors (esp. top-20 = 45% COGS, and branded suppliers)
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Vendor Mgmt (VS-03) / Trade Marketing
Participants: Vendor Mgmt (VS-03), Merchandising (VS-01), Co-op/MDF (VS-39.2), Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4197 — Vendor Co-Funding, Co-Exhibition &amp; MDF Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4197_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4197_Lane1" name="Event Marketing Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4197_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4197_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
