Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / HR / Trade Specialists
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4199_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4199_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
